<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" data-lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Unclaimed</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  /* Layout: fashion-shop minimalism. White page, black type, hairline grids edge to edge, no radius, no shadow. One accent: cream badge. */
  --bg:#FFFFFF; --ink:#000000; --muted:#6E6E6E; --line:#E3E3E3; --tile:#F4F4F2; --cream:#F0EBDD;
  --font:"Manrope","Noto Sans KR","Apple SD Gothic Neo","Malgun Gothic",sans-serif;
  color-scheme:light;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{margin:0}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
[data-lang="ko"] .en,[data-lang="en"] .ko{display:none !important}
a{color:inherit}
a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:2px}
.label{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase}
/* header */
.bar{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);text-align:center;padding:7px 16px}
.bar .label{letter-spacing:.06em}
header.top{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:0 20px;height:56px}
.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.01em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none}
nav.menu{display:flex;gap:22px}
nav.menu a{text-decoration:none}
nav.menu a:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}
.lang{display:flex;gap:12px}
.lang a{text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;background:none;border:0;padding:4px 0;cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted)}
.lang a[aria-current="page"]{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}
/* hero */
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.hero .copy{padding:72px 20px 56px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;gap:18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);line-height:1.08;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;text-wrap:balance}
[data-lang="ko"] .hero h1{text-transform:none;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.2}
.hero p{margin:0;max-width:46ch;color:var(--muted)}
.hero .cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 22px;border:1px solid var(--ink);background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg)}
.btn.ghost{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}
.btn:hover{opacity:.8}
.hero .visual{background:var(--tile);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:40px 20px;min-height:340px;position:relative}
.cards{position:relative;width:min(340px,80%);aspect-ratio:1.4}
.card{position:absolute;inset:0;border:1px solid var(--ink);background:var(--bg);padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}
.card.back{transform:translate(28px,-24px);background:var(--cream)}
.card .big{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.card .row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end}
.stamp{position:absolute;bottom:18px;right:18px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;background:var(--cream);padding:4px 10px;text-transform:uppercase}
/* sections */
section{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.sec-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:44px 20px 18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.sec-head h2{margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;text-transform:uppercase}
[data-lang="ko"] .sec-head h2{text-transform:none}
.sec-head p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);max-width:60ch;font-size:13px}
/* product-style grid */
.grid{display:grid;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.grid>*{border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
.g3>*:nth-child(3n){border-right:0}
.g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
.g4>*:nth-child(4n){border-right:0}
.g2{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
.g2>*:nth-child(2n){border-right:0}
.item .img{background:var(--tile);aspect-ratio:4/3;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative}
.item .img .num{font-size:clamp(34px,4.5vw,58px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.item .tag{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.05em;padding:3px 8px;text-transform:uppercase;background:var(--cream)}
.item .tag.dark{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg)}
.item .meta{padding:12px 14px 18px}
.item .name{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.03em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0}
.item .desc{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:2px 0 0}
/* plans */
.plan{padding:28px 20px}
.plan-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:4px}
.plan h3{margin:0;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-transform:uppercase}
.plan .who{color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px;margin:0 0 20px}
.spec{border-top:1px solid var(--ink)}
.spec>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:16px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px}
.spec dt{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;padding-top:2px}
.spec dd{margin:0}
.spec .x{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:#bbb}
/* helper */
.helper{display:grid;grid-template-columns:320px 1fr;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.list{border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.opt{font:inherit;width:100%;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;text-align:left;background:var(--bg);border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:14px 20px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink)}
.opt .n{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;width:18px}
.opt:hover{background:var(--tile)}
.opt[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg)}
.opt[aria-pressed="true"] .n{color:#9a9a9a}
.result{padding:28px 28px 36px}
.result h3{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.badges{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:24px}
.badge{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.05em;padding:4px 10px;text-transform:uppercase}
.badge.uhip{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg)}
.badge.utsu{background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink)}
.block{margin-bottom:26px}
.block h4{margin:0 0 8px}
.cov{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-top:1px solid var(--ink)}
.cov li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px}
.cov li b{font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;text-align:right}
ol.steps{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;counter-reset:s;border-top:1px solid var(--ink)}
ol.steps li{counter-increment:s;display:flex;gap:14px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px}
ol.steps li::before{content:counter(s,decimal-leading-zero);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);padding-top:2px}
.note{background:var(--cream);padding:11px 14px;font-size:13px}
.note+.note{margin-top:6px}
.checklist{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;border-top:1px solid var(--ink)}
.checklist li{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.checklist label{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;padding:10px 0}
.checklist input{appearance:none;-webkit-appearance:none;width:14px;height:14px;border:1px solid var(--ink);margin:0;flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer}
.checklist input:checked{background:var(--ink)}
.checklist input:checked::after{content:"";width:6px;height:3px;border-left:1.5px solid #fff;border-bottom:1.5px solid #fff;transform:rotate(-45deg) translate(1px,-1px)}
.checklist input:checked+span{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:line-through}
/* route & dates */
.stop{padding:22px 20px 26px}
.stop .when{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.05em;padding:3px 8px;text-transform:uppercase;background:var(--tile)}
.stop.alert .when{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg)}
.stop h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800}
.stop p{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.dates{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.date{display:grid;grid-template-columns:260px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.date:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.date .d{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.03em;text-transform:uppercase;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.date p{margin:0;font-size:13px}
.date .sub{color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}
/* footer */
footer{padding:48px 20px 56px}
.join{text-align:center;padding-bottom:40px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:32px}
.join .big{font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 6px}
[data-lang="ko"] .join .big{text-transform:none}
.join p{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
.fcols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr;gap:32px}
.fcols ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:10px 0 0;display:grid;gap:4px;font-size:12.5px}
.fcols a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted)}
.fcols a:hover{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:underline}
.fine{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:10px 0 0;max-width:56ch}
.copy-line{margin-top:40px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.03em;text-transform:uppercase}
@media (max-width:900px){
  nav.menu{display:none}
  .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .hero .copy{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:48px}
  .g4{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .g4>*:nth-child(4n){border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
  .g4>*:nth-child(2n){border-right:0}
  .g3{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .g3>*:nth-child(3n){border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
  .g3>*:nth-child(2n){border-right:0}
  .helper{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .list{border-right:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .list .opt:nth-child(odd){border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
  .fcols{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .fcols>div:first-child{grid-column:1/-1}
}
@media (max-width:620px){
  .g2{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .g2>*{border-right:0 !important}
  .date{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:4px}
  .spec>div{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2px}
  .result{padding:24px 20px 32px}
  .hero .visual{min-height:260px}
}
@media (max-width:420px){
  .g3,.g4{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .g3>*,.g4>*{border-right:0 !important}
  .list{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .list .opt{border-right:0 !important}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="bar"><span class="label"><span class="ko">2026–27 보험 연도 진행 중 · 치과 $800 아직 안 쓰셨나요?</span><span class="en">2026–27 policy year now on · Have you used your $800 dental yet?</span></span></div>
<header class="top">
  <a class="logo" href="#top">Unclaimed</a>
  <nav class="menu label" aria-label="Sections">
    <a href="#plans"><span class="ko">내 보험</span><span class="en">Plans</span></a>
    <a href="#helper"><span class="ko">청구 도우미</span><span class="en">Claim helper</span></a>
    <a href="#perks"><span class="ko">혜택</span><span class="en">Benefits</span></a>
    <a href="#where"><span class="ko">어디로 가나</span><span class="en">Where to go</span></a>
    <a href="#dates"><span class="ko">기한</span><span class="en">Deadlines</span></a>
  </nav>
  <div class="hdr-right">
    <button type="button" class="cb-launch" id="cb-launch" aria-controls="cb-panel" aria-expanded="false"><span class="cb-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ko">보험 질문하기</span><span class="en">Ask a question</span></button>
  <nav class="lang" aria-label="Language">
      <a aria-current="page" href="index.html" hreflang="ko">KOR</a>
      <a href="en.html" hreflang="en">ENG</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="top">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="copy">
      <div class="label"><span class="ko">U of T St. George 유학생 보험 가이드</span><span class="en">For U of T St. George international students</span></div>
      <h1><span class="ko">이미 낸 보험,<br>끝까지 챙기세요.</span><span class="en">Claim what's<br>already yours.</span></h1>
      <p><span class="ko">풀타임 학부 유학생은 학비와 함께 UHIP과 UTSU 플랜, 두 개의 보험에 가입돼 있어요. 무엇이 커버되는지, 어디에 청구하는지 한 곳에서 확인하세요.</span><span class="en">As a full-time international undergrad, your tuition already includes two plans: UHIP and the UTSU Health &amp; Dental Plan. See what's covered and where to claim, in one place.</span></p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn" href="#helper"><span class="ko">청구 도우미 열기</span><span class="en">Open claim helper</span></a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="#perks"><span class="ko">놓친 혜택 보기</span><span class="en">See missed benefits</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card back"><div class="label">UTSU Health &amp; Dental</div><div class="row"><span class="big">$800</span><span class="label">Dental / yr</span></div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="label">UHIP · 2026–27</div><div class="row"><span class="big">$948</span><span class="label">Paid / yr</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <span class="stamp">Unclaimed</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="plans" aria-labelledby="h-plans">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 id="h-plans"><span class="ko">내 보험 두 개</span><span class="en">Your two plans</span></h2>
      <p><span class="ko">UHIP은 의사와 병원, UTSU 플랜은 약·치과·안경·상담처럼 UHIP이 안 해주는 것들.</span><span class="en">UHIP is for doctors and hospitals. The UTSU plan fills the gaps: drugs, dental, glasses, counselling.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid g2">
      <article class="plan">
        <div class="plan-head"><h3>UHIP</h3><span class="badge uhip"><span class="ko">필수</span><span class="en">Mandatory</span></span></div>
        <p class="who"><span class="ko">University Health Insurance Plan · 관리: Cowan</span><span class="en">University Health Insurance Plan · run by Cowan</span></p>
        <dl class="spec">
          <div><dt><span class="ko">커버</span><span class="en">Covers</span></dt><dd><span class="ko">의사 진료, 응급실·입원, 혈액검사·X-ray·MRI, 구급차</span><span class="en">Doctor visits, ER &amp; hospital, blood work, X-ray, MRI, ambulance</span></dd></div>
          <div><dt><span class="ko">안 됨</span><span class="en">Not covered</span></dt><dd class="x"><span class="ko">외래 처방약, 일반 치과, 안경, 침술</span><span class="en">Prescriptions, dental care, glasses, acupuncture</span></dd></div>
          <div><dt><span class="ko">청구</span><span class="en">Claims</span></dt><dd><span class="ko">카드(앱)를 보여주면 대부분 병원이 Cowan에 직접 청구. 직접 냈다면 <a href="https://clients.cowangroup.ca">clients.cowangroup.ca</a>에서 영수증으로 청구.</span><span class="en">Most clinics bill Cowan directly when you show your card. If you paid, claim at <a href="https://clients.cowangroup.ca">clients.cowangroup.ca</a>.</span></dd></div>
          <div><dt><span class="ko">연락처</span><span class="en">Contact</span></dt><dd>Cowan 1-833-377-8447</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </article>
      <article class="plan">
        <div class="plan-head"><h3>UTSU Plan</h3><span class="badge utsu"><span class="ko">학생회</span><span class="en">Student union</span></span></div>
        <p class="who"><span class="ko">Health &amp; Dental · 운영: Studentcare(Alumo) · 청구: GreenShield</span><span class="en">Health &amp; Dental · run by Studentcare (Alumo) · claims via GreenShield</span></p>
        <dl class="spec">
          <div><dt><span class="ko">커버</span><span class="en">Covers</span></dt><dd><span class="ko">처방약 80%, 치과 연 $800, 시력·안경, 물리치료·마사지, 심리상담, 여행 보험</span><span class="en">Drugs 80%, dental $800/yr, vision, physio &amp; massage, counselling, travel</span></dd></div>
          <div><dt><span class="ko">회원 ID</span><span class="en">Member ID</span></dt><dd><span class="ko">"UTS" + 학번 (예: UTS1012345678)</span><span class="en">"UTS" + student number (e.g. UTS1012345678)</span></dd></div>
          <div><dt><span class="ko">청구</span><span class="en">Claims</span></dt><dd><span class="ko">GreenShield 웹사이트·앱에서 온라인 청구. <strong>이용일로부터 12개월 안에</strong> 접수.</span><span class="en">Online through GreenShield. Must arrive <strong>within 12 months</strong> of the service date.</span></dd></div>
          <div><dt><span class="ko">연락처</span><span class="en">Contact</span></dt><dd>UTSU 416-978-4911 · hello@utsu.ca</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="helper" aria-labelledby="h-helper">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 id="h-helper"><span class="ko">청구 도우미</span><span class="en">Claim helper</span></h2>
      <p><span class="ko">받았거나 받을 진료를 고르면, 어느 보험이 얼마나 내주는지와 청구 방법을 보여드려요.</span><span class="en">Pick what you got, or are about to get. See which plan pays, how much, and how to claim.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="helper">
      <div class="list" id="chips" role="group" aria-label="Situation"></div>
      <div class="result" id="result" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="perks" aria-labelledby="h-perks">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 id="h-perks"><span class="ko">놓치기 쉬운 혜택</span><span class="en">Benefits people forget</span></h2>
      <p><span class="ko">매년 9월 1일~8월 31일 기준. 안 쓰면 그냥 사라져요.</span><span class="en">Policy year runs Sept 1 to Aug 31. Unused amounts don't roll over.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid g3">
      <div class="item"><div class="img"><span class="tag">Best</span><span class="num">$800</span></div><div class="meta"><p class="name"><span class="ko">치과</span><span class="en">Dental</span></p><p class="desc"><span class="ko">검진·스케일링 70% · 연 1회는 꼭</span><span class="en">Exams &amp; cleanings 70% · go once a year</span></p></div></div>
      <div class="item"><div class="img"><span class="num">$100×15</span></div><div class="meta"><p class="name"><span class="ko">심리상담</span><span class="en">Counselling</span></p><p class="desc"><span class="ko">회당 최대 $100 · 연 15회</span><span class="en">Up to $100 a visit · 15 a year</span></p></div></div>
